            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "abertura",
            "recommendedMoment": "early",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P02",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F02",
            "text": "Os atributos do bem estão distribuídos por duas ilhas próximas da costa continental.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "territorio",
            "signalStrength": "abertura",
            "recommendedMoment": "early",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P03",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F03",
            "text": "Uma ilha vizinha e uma cidade do continente, com ruínas próprias, ficaram fora dos limites, e há proposta de incluí-las.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO",
              "KILWA_SOC2023"
            ],
            "clueType": "territorio",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P04",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F04",
            "text": "É testemunho arquitetônico, arqueológico e documental da expansão da cultura e do comércio suaíli do século IX ao XIX.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "patrimonio",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P05",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F05",
            "text": "O comércio ligava o interior africano, fonte de ouro e marfim, a mercados da Arábia, da Índia e da China.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "processo",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P06",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F06",
            "text": "A cunhagem de moeda própria, do século XI ao XIV, acompanhou o enriquecimento trazido pelo comércio.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO",
              "KILWA_NATGEO"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P07",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F07",
            "text": "Os governantes miraram o ouro, tradicionalmente exportado por Sofala, e a cidade passou a dominar esse comércio na Idade Média.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_NATGEO"
            ],
            "clueType": "processo",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P08",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F08",
            "text": "Ibn Battuta a visitou em 1331–1332, no período de maior prosperidade.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P09",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F09",
            "text": "A grande mesquita, iniciada no século XI e ampliada no XIII, tem dezesseis vãos cobertos por cúpulas e abóbadas.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "KILWA_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "construcao",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-geografo-P10",
            "factKey": "ruinas-kilwa-songo-F10",
            "text": "Erguido por volta de 1310–1333, o palácio Husuni Kubwa combinava residência, forte e armazém.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C3"
            ],
